## The screens

The game moves between six screens. `specs/screens.md` fixes the transitions,
the menus, and the screen copy.

| Screen | What it shows |
| --- | --- |
| `title` | The game's title and the menu. |
| `howto` | The controls and a summary of the rules. |
| `playing` | The field and the HUD. |
| `waveclear` | The wave-clear banner over the field. |
| `paused` | The pause overlay and its menu over the field. |
| `gameover` | GAME OVER, the final score, and the wave reached. |

